# 24. Checking NetworkPolicies

List policies:

```bash
kubectl get networkpolicy
```

or:

```bash
kubectl get netpol
```

Across all namespaces:

```bash
kubectl get networkpolicy -A
```

Describe:

```bash
kubectl describe networkpolicy backend-ingress
```

Get YAML:

```bash
kubectl get networkpolicy backend-ingress -o yaml
```

